1
00:02:31,017 --> 00:02:36,017
This is the time known as the Great Pirate Era.

2
00:02:36,017 --> 00:02:39,017
A countless array of pirates go to battle across the seas

3
00:02:39,017 --> 00:02:41,017
in search of the One Piece,

4
00:02:41,017 --> 00:02:44,017
a legendary treasure left behind by Gold Watcher,

5
00:02:44,017 --> 00:02:45,017
King of the Pirates.

6
00:02:45,017 --> 00:02:48,017
Bucky D. Luffy, a boy whose body turned to rubber

7
00:02:48,017 --> 00:02:50,017
after eating the gum gum fruit,

8
00:02:50,017 --> 00:02:53,017
set sail to become the next King of the Pirates.

9
00:02:53,017 --> 00:02:56,017
As Luffy and his crew conquer numerous obstacles,

10
00:02:56,017 --> 00:02:59,017
they capture the unwanted attention of the world government,

11
00:02:59,017 --> 00:03:02,017
which will use any means necessary to stop them.

12
00:03:02,017 --> 00:03:05,017
Now, this is exciting!

13
00:03:05,017 --> 00:03:08,017
Can't wait to see what kind of adventure's up next!

14
00:03:08,017 --> 00:03:12,017
With a charted course awash in danger and intrigue,

15
00:03:12,017 --> 00:03:17,017
the crew will cut a path across the Grand Line to the New World.

16
00:03:19,017 --> 00:03:21,017
After being separated from his crew,

17
00:03:21,017 --> 00:03:24,017
Luffy set out to rescue his captured brother, Ace.

18
00:03:24,017 --> 00:03:27,017
To do so, he snuck into the government prison, Impel Down.

19
00:03:27,017 --> 00:03:30,017
Now, with Team Bay and Crocodile at his side,

20
00:03:30,017 --> 00:03:32,017
they're in the midst of a huge battle on level four.

21
00:03:34,017 --> 00:03:36,017
This is the Great Fortress of Hell!

22
00:03:36,017 --> 00:03:37,017
None shall pass!

23
00:03:37,017 --> 00:03:38,017
Now be gone!

24
00:03:42,017 --> 00:03:43,017
Refusal to be defeated!

25
00:03:43,017 --> 00:03:45,017
Sirius Hannibal!

26
00:03:45,017 --> 00:03:55,017
Who's this doofus?

27
00:03:55,017 --> 00:03:58,017
Why'd he open the doors all the way?

28
00:03:58,017 --> 00:03:59,017
That's Hannibal.

29
00:03:59,017 --> 00:04:01,017
He's the vice-warden of the prison.

30
00:04:05,017 --> 00:04:06,017
Fire!

31
00:04:15,017 --> 00:04:20,017
Take a look!

32
00:04:24,017 --> 00:04:28,017
We've got a thousand troops armed with a thousand cage-shot bazookas

33
00:04:28,017 --> 00:04:30,017
packed into the stairway to level three.

34
00:04:34,017 --> 00:04:36,017
It's the end of the line!

35
00:04:36,017 --> 00:04:38,017
This is as far as you go!

36
00:04:38,017 --> 00:04:48,017
What's with the vice-warden? He's all fired up!

37
00:04:48,017 --> 00:04:50,017
You think that's another impostor?

38
00:04:50,017 --> 00:04:51,017
You think that's another impostor?

39
00:04:51,017 --> 00:04:52,017
How's it going?!

40
00:04:52,017 --> 00:04:54,017
Huh?

41
00:05:15,217 --> 00:05:18,517
In order to guarantee the safe future of all innocent citizens,

42
00:05:19,217 --> 00:05:21,717
you, Straw Hat, must be eradicated!

43
00:05:23,017 --> 00:05:26,017
I hereby sent you to death on behalf of the Warden!

44
00:05:32,017 --> 00:05:34,017
That can't be the same Vice Warden I know.

45
00:05:36,017 --> 00:05:37,017
Move!

46
00:05:38,017 --> 00:05:40,017
Try and make me!

47
00:05:43,017 --> 00:05:45,017
I'm in a hurry!

48
00:05:45,017 --> 00:05:46,017
Yes!

49
00:05:52,017 --> 00:05:53,017
Nice move!

50
00:05:53,017 --> 00:05:54,017
Hey, and look at his halberd!

51
00:05:55,017 --> 00:05:57,017
That's the Bloodsucker!

52
00:05:59,017 --> 00:06:00,017
Bastard!

53
00:06:01,017 --> 00:06:04,017
You shouldn't underestimate me!

54
00:06:05,017 --> 00:06:06,017
He actually knows what he's doing!

55
00:06:07,017 --> 00:06:09,017
I'm here! I thought he was only good at complaining!

56
00:06:10,017 --> 00:06:11,017
Yeah!

57
00:06:11,017 --> 00:06:12,017
YEEE!

58
00:06:12,017 --> 00:06:22,297
Heya! Heya! Heya! Heya! Heya! Heya! Heya!

59
00:06:30,437 --> 00:06:34,677
That's right! The Heya Hustle Dance! The Infernal Hell Wheel!

60
00:06:42,017 --> 00:06:48,197
If I don't get the hell out of my way, I'll make you! I gotta save him!

61
00:06:48,277 --> 00:06:49,517
You gotta be joking!

62
00:06:49,777 --> 00:06:53,917
What kind of vice-woman would I be if I stepped aside just because an inmate asked me?

63
00:07:07,917 --> 00:07:09,057
Second gear!

64
00:07:09,057 --> 00:07:09,317
Huh?

65
00:07:09,317 --> 00:07:12,157
Now come, come!

66
00:07:12,457 --> 00:07:13,097
Jack!

67
00:07:13,717 --> 00:07:14,477
Jack!

68
00:07:14,477 --> 00:07:14,497
Jack!

69
00:07:14,497 --> 00:07:14,817
Jack!

70
00:07:35,197 --> 00:07:36,977
We've been praying you'd arrive.

71
00:07:36,977 --> 00:07:40,477
You've got to do something, Warden Magellan.

72
00:07:49,217 --> 00:07:53,457
Where are the ringleaders behind this uprising?

73
00:07:53,997 --> 00:07:55,997
They're in front of the staircase to level three,

74
00:07:56,277 --> 00:07:58,457
