99
00:09:15,937 --> 00:09:17,457
Take extra precaution with her.

100
00:09:18,977 --> 00:09:20,217
Just my time!

101
00:09:20,417 --> 00:09:21,777
Why did I say that out loud?

102
00:09:23,677 --> 00:09:25,137
Well, he was easy.

103
00:09:25,857 --> 00:09:27,417
Like every other man.

104
00:09:28,177 --> 00:09:30,477
Wait, I have to strip down naked?

105
00:09:30,917 --> 00:09:33,197
Could you at least be polite enough to look away?

106
00:09:33,197 --> 00:09:35,157
Uh, sure!

107
00:09:36,237 --> 00:09:37,357
So, dressed yet?

108
00:09:38,297 --> 00:09:39,957
Um, not yet.

109
00:09:41,577 --> 00:09:42,737
Such a fool.

110
00:09:42,997 --> 00:09:44,237
