115
00:09:55,757 --> 00:09:56,317
Ouch!

116
00:09:56,437 --> 00:09:59,017
It doesn't matter if you're working on level one or six.

117
00:09:59,177 --> 00:10:01,137
All duties are equally important here.

118
00:10:01,137 --> 00:10:04,497
If one person fails, the entire system fails.

119
00:10:04,597 --> 00:10:07,237
You must keep that in mind at all times.

120
00:10:20,017 --> 00:10:21,017
