121
00:10:24,017 --> 00:10:26,277
I'm not through with you yet!

122
00:10:26,277 --> 00:10:26,837
Whoa!

123
00:10:26,837 --> 00:10:38,237
You won't pass!

124
00:10:38,457 --> 00:10:40,717
You won't pass!

125
00:10:40,957 --> 00:10:42,457
You won't pass!

126
00:10:42,837 --> 00:10:43,257
Yes!

127
00:10:44,077 --> 00:10:45,537
You won't pass!

128
00:10:45,897 --> 00:10:46,377
You won't pass!

129
00:10:46,377 --> 00:10:47,197
You won't pass!

130
00:10:51,677 --> 00:10:53,537
Follow the vice warden's lead!

131
00:10:53,537 --> 00:10:54,837
Don't hold back!

132
00:10:54,837 --> 00:10:54,897
Don't hold back!

133
00:10:58,537 --> 00:10:59,317
Move it!

134
00:11:01,697 --> 00:11:03,497
I'm gonna save my brother!

135
00:11:04,497 --> 00:11:04,877
Yeah!

136
00:11:04,877 --> 00:11:29,877
You should worry about saving your own life!

137
00:11:30,877 --> 00:11:33,877
To my way!

138
00:11:37,877 --> 00:11:39,877
Bastard...

139
00:11:39,877 --> 00:11:42,877
You are not getting past me!

140
00:11:42,877 --> 00:11:45,877
Tom's of...

141
00:11:45,877 --> 00:11:48,877
Jack's kill!

142
00:11:52,877 --> 00:11:55,877
Don't move!

143
00:11:55,877 --> 00:11:57,877
Just quit already!

144
00:11:57,877 --> 00:12:00,877
Dammit! I don't have time for this crap!

145
00:12:08,877 --> 00:12:11,877
You're not getting past me!

146
00:12:11,877 --> 00:12:17,877
You're the king of diarrhea! You hear me?

147
00:12:17,877 --> 00:12:20,877
You should wear a toilet seat for a crown!

148
00:12:20,877 --> 00:12:22,877
He's been screaming insults for more than 30 minutes now!

149
00:12:22,877 --> 00:12:24,877
That's our Captain Buggy! He's the best!

150
00:12:24,877 --> 00:12:27,877
Your mom should have flushed you, you turd!

151
00:12:30,877 --> 00:12:36,877
I'm all out of insults. It had a good run, but you can only stretch this turd thing so far!

152
00:12:36,877 --> 00:12:39,877
You doing okay there?

153
00:12:40,877 --> 00:12:46,877
Magellan's pretty tough to eat up all this abuse, huh? I gotta take a quick bathroom break.

154
00:12:46,877 --> 00:12:50,877
Wait, you don't mean... did he go and give himself diarrhea?

155
00:12:52,877 --> 00:12:54,877
Nope, gotta piss, that's all.

156
00:12:54,877 --> 00:12:58,877
Good idea! We haven't peed in hours!

157
00:13:09,877 --> 00:13:11,877
What the hell should I do?

158
00:13:11,877 --> 00:13:16,877
If I can't get through that wall of poison, not only are we stuck here, but my reputation will be ruined too!

159
00:13:16,877 --> 00:13:18,877
That ain't what's it gonna take!

160
00:13:43,877 --> 00:13:45,877
What a joke! That's supposed to stop odds?

161
00:13:46,877 --> 00:13:50,877
Try they might to avoid destiny, fate marches on nonetheless...

162
00:13:51,877 --> 00:13:52,877
Liberation!

163
00:13:53,877 --> 00:13:55,877
Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha!

164
00:13:56,877 --> 00:13:57,877
Ha ha ha ha ha ha!

165
00:14:16,877 --> 00:14:22,877
That's a long link you're taking there!

166
00:14:23,877 --> 00:14:25,877
Captain Buggy, you gotta see this!

167
00:14:26,877 --> 00:14:27,877
Is something wrong?

168
00:14:28,877 --> 00:14:32,877
