171
00:14:36,877 --> 00:14:41,877
There's not even a single trace of the poison left!

172
00:14:41,877 --> 00:14:42,877
Ha ha ha ha ha ha!

173
00:14:42,877 --> 00:14:43,877
Huh?

174
00:14:43,877 --> 00:14:48,877
My barrage of devastating insults finally got to him!

175
00:14:49,877 --> 00:14:51,877
That's right! It was a pain, but it paid off!

176
00:14:52,877 --> 00:14:56,877
Amazing! So you really were battling Magellan's venom with your venomous tongue!

177
00:14:56,877 --> 00:14:57,877
You're a badass!

178
00:14:58,877 --> 00:15:01,877
Cool! The being was also part of your attack, right?

179
00:15:01,877 --> 00:15:04,877
No. There's nothing about this that makes any sense.

180
00:15:04,877 --> 00:15:10,877
All right! I've destroyed the blockade! Fallen behind and follow me to freedom!

181
00:15:10,877 --> 00:15:19,877
I told you! I'm in a hurry! Get out of my way!

182
00:15:20,877 --> 00:15:21,877
I tell I will!

183
00:15:21,877 --> 00:15:23,877
Just move, you pot-bellied weirdo!

184
00:15:23,877 --> 00:15:25,877
You're not taking a single step!

185
00:15:25,877 --> 00:15:28,877
You don't have time for this! I got the important things to do!

186
00:15:28,877 --> 00:15:41,877
All right! I'm leaving here! And I'm saving it!

187
00:15:45,877 --> 00:15:49,877
You keep saying you want to save your brother like at some noble quest!

188
00:15:49,877 --> 00:15:52,877
But I know you're nothing but scum! Both of you!

189
00:15:58,877 --> 00:16:03,877
All the pirates and rebels here, you don't give a damn about anyone but yourselves!

190
00:16:04,877 --> 00:16:06,877
Stop my sword and you've done enough!

191
00:16:06,877 --> 00:16:07,877
Don't stand up!

192
00:16:07,877 --> 00:16:08,877
You're gonna get killed!

193
00:16:09,877 --> 00:16:12,877
As long as scum like you are free to terrorize the seas,

194
00:16:12,877 --> 00:16:16,877
decent people can't even sleep at night because they're worried about losing their loved ones!

195
00:16:17,877 --> 00:16:19,877
This jail was built to protect them!

196
00:16:20,877 --> 00:16:24,877
Locking up evil criminals like you is the only way to give them some peace of mind!

197
00:16:24,877 --> 00:16:27,877
This fortress is the floodgate of hell!

198
00:16:27,877 --> 00:16:31,877
And I won't let the world drown in terror by letting prisoners break free!

199
00:16:31,877 --> 00:16:36,877
So like I already said, you won't take a single step!

200
00:16:38,877 --> 00:16:39,877
Bye, sport!

201
00:16:57,877 --> 00:17:01,877
The only thing I want is to save my brother! So move it!

202
00:17:02,877 --> 00:17:04,877
You're too dumb to understand!

203
00:17:05,877 --> 00:17:07,877
Bye, sport! Help us!

204
00:17:14,877 --> 00:17:16,877
Hey! What's happening in there?

205
00:17:16,877 --> 00:17:18,877
Buttercork in it already!

206
00:17:18,877 --> 00:17:24,877
All this blathering about what's right and wrong in the world!

207
00:17:25,877 --> 00:17:28,877
If you'd look at the world from outside your damn prison,

208
00:17:29,877 --> 00:17:31,877
it seems not so black and white!

209
00:17:31,877 --> 00:17:33,877
So cut the crap!

210
00:17:33,877 --> 00:17:34,877
So cut the crap!

211
00:17:34,877 --> 00:17:35,877
Huh?

212
00:17:35,877 --> 00:17:36,877
Huh?

213
00:17:36,877 --> 00:17:37,877
Huh?

214
00:17:37,877 --> 00:17:38,877
Huh?

215
00:17:38,877 --> 00:17:40,877
That guy! I met him in Jaya!

216
00:17:40,877 --> 00:17:41,877
the player!

217
00:17:45,817 --> 00:17:46,877
Huh?

218
00:17:46,877 --> 00:17:48,877
Uh...

219
00:17:48,877 --> 00:17:49,877
Oh, wow!

220
00:17:49,877 --> 00:17:51,877
Wow!

221
00:17:51,877 --> 00:18:05,197
Oh, wow. Wow.

222
00:18:06,197 --> 00:18:09,137
Well, ain't this a fine trip down memory lane.

223
00:18:10,757 --> 00:18:13,817
Looks like we got you boys right in the middle of something.

224
00:18:15,777 --> 00:18:19,517
Hello, teach. Mind telling us what the hell you're doing here?

225
00:18:19,517 --> 00:18:24,337
Huh? Well, or do you only answer to Blackbeard now?

226
00:18:26,517 --> 00:18:26,997
Jinbei.

227
00:18:29,177 --> 00:18:33,097
Hey, hey, what's with the hostility? Why don't you loosen up those fists there?

228
00:18:33,877 --> 00:18:36,857
Oh, yeah, I forgot you and Ace are pretty tight.

229
00:18:36,997 --> 00:18:40,157
But hey, there's not much point in caring about him anymore.

230
00:18:46,077 --> 00:18:46,597
Blackbeard.

231
00:18:46,597 --> 00:18:49,837
I can't right now. I'm chasing someone.

232
00:18:51,757 --> 00:18:53,717
He's a pirate named Blackbeard.

233
00:18:53,857 --> 00:18:58,997
The dreams of pirates will never end!

234
00:18:59,197 --> 00:19:04,077
According to this, a pirate named Blackbeard defeated Ace and gave him up to the world government.

235
00:19:04,417 --> 00:19:06,737
In return, they invited him to be a warlord.

236
00:19:10,277 --> 00:19:11,117
Blackbeard, huh?

237
00:19:11,117 --> 00:19:15,437
I see.

238
00:19:18,377 --> 00:19:18,737
Huh?

239
00:19:21,377 --> 00:19:22,517
So you're...

240
00:19:22,517 --> 00:19:24,817
Blackbeard!

241
00:19:25,537 --> 00:19:29,157
Huh? Oh, right. I guess I never gave you my name, did I?

242
00:19:29,697 --> 00:19:30,057
Z-

243
00:19:30,057 --> 00:19:34,177
Long time no see, straw hat, Luffy.

244
00:19:35,297 --> 00:19:36,917
Hey, I know how you feel.

245
00:19:37,117 --> 00:19:40,817
I was surprised myself when I heard you were my old commander's baby brother.

246
00:19:41,457 --> 00:19:44,617
What are you doing down here? You're gonna miss the big show.

247
00:19:45,017 --> 00:19:47,957
Don't you want to be there for your brother's public execution?

248
00:19:47,957 --> 00:19:48,757
Z-

249
00:19:48,757 --> 00:19:56,577
And this washed up former warlord over here.

250
00:19:57,037 --> 00:19:58,477
Yeah, I mean you, crocodile.

251
00:19:59,137 --> 00:20:03,917
I heard you got your ass handed to you, but I didn't know straw hat, Luffy, was the one to do it.

252
00:20:05,917 --> 00:20:10,577
Funny thing is, I was trying to take crocodile's place as a warlord at the time.

253
00:20:10,577 --> 00:20:15,657
So killing you was about the best way I could think of to show the government I was worthy of the position.

254
00:20:22,457 --> 00:20:24,877
Let's stop beating around the bush now, shall we?

255
00:20:25,937 --> 00:20:28,777
Even if you play dumb, I know you're a crafty bastard.

256
00:20:29,217 --> 00:20:31,997
There's only one reason for me to be here, and you know what it is.

257
00:20:32,057 --> 00:20:34,257
Whitebeard's days are numbered and you know it.

258
00:20:34,497 --> 00:20:36,377
I'm gonna be king of the pirates.

259
00:20:36,377 --> 00:20:42,177
First, I'm headed off to Water 7 to kill straw hat Luffy as a special gift to the world government.

260
00:20:42,757 --> 00:20:44,717
Wouldn't hurt to have you along for the fun.

261
00:20:45,297 --> 00:20:46,177
Luffy, huh?

262
00:20:47,117 --> 00:20:48,517
You're out of your mind.

263
00:20:49,097 --> 00:20:50,477
Oh, you know him?

264
00:20:50,597 --> 00:20:52,717
Of course I know him, you sack of crap.

265
00:20:53,557 --> 00:20:55,637
I'm not gonna let you kill my little brother.

266
00:20:57,097 --> 00:20:58,897
And yet here you are.

267
00:20:59,817 --> 00:21:02,257
Fate decided to save you instead.

268
00:21:02,257 --> 00:21:07,637
Ace had been chasing after me to get revenge for my so-called crime on Whitebeard's ship.

269
00:21:07,997 --> 00:21:09,777
And I had been chasing you.

270
00:21:10,377 --> 00:21:14,097
Of course I couldn't team up with him to kill you, but it all worked out.

271
00:21:14,437 --> 00:21:16,317
Because we both got the fight we wanted.

272
00:21:17,597 --> 00:21:23,577
If I surrender to you, then I can never call myself a man again.

273
00:21:24,437 --> 00:21:27,777
I won't submit and I won't live with regrets no matter what.

274
00:21:28,477 --> 00:21:29,497
You got that, stupid?

275
00:21:29,497 --> 00:21:33,097
Z-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!

276
00:21:33,117 --> 00:21:35,237
The Sun Against Darkness, huh?

277
00:21:35,237 --> 00:21:36,937
Only one can win!

278
00:21:37,877 --> 00:21:39,817
I'll make Whitebeard the king.

279
00:21:40,297 --> 00:21:41,737
Or die trying.

280
00:21:43,677 --> 00:21:45,657
Z-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!

281
00:21:45,657 --> 00:21:49,657
Aaaaaaah!

282
00:21:53,657 --> 00:21:56,657
Henry ain't it. If he'd let us get away,

283
00:21:56,657 --> 00:21:59,657
he'd not only disgrace Whitebeard's name,

284
00:21:59,657 --> 00:22:03,657
but he'd also be turning his back on his brother and leaving you to die.

285
00:22:03,657 --> 00:22:07,657
There is no such thing as coincidence when it comes to fate, truly.

286
00:22:08,657 --> 00:22:12,657
Yeah, and you got lucky, kiddo. You weren't fated to die.

287
00:22:12,657 --> 00:22:17,657
Our captain achieved his goal of becoming a warlord thanks to your brother,

288
00:22:17,657 --> 00:22:19,657
so you're thoroughly useless to us now.

289
00:22:21,657 --> 00:22:24,657
Whee-ha-ha! Ole's put up a brave fight,

290
00:22:24,657 --> 00:22:26,657
but it just didn't work out for him.

291
00:22:27,657 --> 00:22:31,657
Better make sure you pay your humble respects at his grave, Straw Hat.

292
00:22:32,657 --> 00:22:34,657
He went and took your place for you,

293
00:22:34,657 --> 00:22:36,657
because if it weren't for your brother,

294
00:22:36,657 --> 00:22:39,657
you'd be dead and he'd be walking free.

295
00:22:43,657 --> 00:22:47,657
If that's the truth, try to kill me now!

296
00:22:47,657 --> 00:22:48,657
Huh?

297
00:22:49,657 --> 00:22:51,657
Gom Gom!

298
00:22:54,657 --> 00:22:55,657
Jack!

299
00:22:57,657 --> 00:22:59,657
Aaaaaaah!

300
00:22:59,657 --> 00:23:15,657
Amidst the chaotic jailbreak, Luffy finds himself face to face with Blackbeard.

301
00:23:15,657 --> 00:23:20,657
The pie-loving pirate then reveals that he was the one who captured Ace and turned him into the Navy.

302
00:23:20,657 --> 00:23:25,657
Ignoring more pressing concerns, Luffy loses control and is provoked into battle.

303
00:23:25,657 --> 00:23:30,657
On the next One Piece, Jet Pistol of Anger, Luffy versus Blackbeard,

304
00:23:30,657 --> 00:23:32,657
I'm gonna be king of the pirates!

305
